{"seq":2,"slug":"diff-merge-algorithms","title":"差分与合并算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals/diff-merge-algorithms","wordCount":1571,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"差分与合并算法\">差分与合并算法</h1><p>你每天盯着 <code>git diff</code> 的输出做 review，每次解 <a href=\"../core-operations/merging-rebasing\">合并冲突</a> 都在依赖 Git 替你判断「谁改了什么」，但很少有人追问：Git 是怎么决定「这几行是新增、那几行是修改」的？为什么换个 diff 算法，同一处改动的展示会更清爽？这一篇拆开 diff 与合并背后的经典算法——它们决定了你看到的差异是否「像人会怎么改」，以及 Git 能否在不打扰你的情况下自动合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>diff 的核心是一个组合优化问题：把旧文本变成新文本，最少需要哪些「删除」和「插入」操作？等价地说，就是找两段文本的<strong>最长公共子序列（LCS）</strong>——保留尽可能多的共同行，剩下的就是改动。合并则在 diff 之上再进一步：用<strong>三路合并</strong>，借助共同祖先把「两方各自的改动」对齐、自动融合，冲突处才交给人。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>逐行 diff</strong>：以行为单位求最短编辑脚本（SES），是 <code>git diff</code> 的默认粒度。</li>\n<li><strong>LCS / Myers 算法</strong>：求解最短编辑脚本的经典方法，Git 默认 diff 的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>histogram / patience</strong>：替代算法，在重复行多的代码上常给出更易读的差异。</li>\n<li><strong>三路合并</strong>：以 merge base 为基准，区分双方改动并自动融合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下表对比 Git 支持的几种 diff 算法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>myers（默认）</td>\n<td>最短编辑脚本</td>\n<td>编辑量最小、通用</td>\n<td>多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>minimal</td>\n<td>在 myers 上更激进求最小</td>\n<td>差异行数最少</td>\n<td>追求最简 diff</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>patience</td>\n<td>先锚定唯一行再分治</td>\n<td>重排/移动更可读</td>\n<td>大块重排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>histogram</td>\n<td>patience 改进、更快</td>\n<td>兼顾速度与可读</td>\n<td>大文件、代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lcs-与编辑距离-diff-的数学骨架\">LCS 与编辑距离：diff 的数学骨架</h2><p>把两段文本看成行的序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）。diff 要找的是一条「编辑路径」，用最少的插入/删除把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>。这等价于求二者的最长公共子序列：公共子序列越长，需要改动的行越少。朴素的动态规划用一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的表，时间和空间都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(mn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L[i][j] = \\begin{cases} L[i-1][j-1]+1 &amp; A_i = B_j \\\\ \\max(L[i-1][j],\\ L[i][j-1]) &amp; A_i \\neq B_j \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对几万行的文件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(mn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 太慢。这就是 Myers 算法的价值所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"myers-算法-git-的默认引擎\">Myers 算法：Git 的默认引擎</h2><p>Eugene Myers 1986 年的算法不直接填满整张 DP 表，而是把问题建模成在一张「编辑图」上找最短路径，沿对角线（公共行）尽可能走，用一个按编辑距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 推进的贪心搜索找到最短编辑脚本。它的复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((m+n)\\cdot D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是实际编辑距离——当两个版本差异不大（绝大多数提交都是小改动）时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 很小，于是实际运行近乎线性，远快于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(mn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Myers 复杂度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>D</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 时极快</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Myers 复杂度} = O\\big((m+n)\\cdot D\\big),\\quad D \\ll \\min(m,n)\\ \\text{时极快}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Myers </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复杂度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时极快</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了为什么 <code>git diff</code> 即便在大文件上也几乎瞬时——它利用了「相邻版本差异小」这个现实假设。这与 <a href=\"storage-packfiles\">存储与 packfile</a> 里 delta 编码「相邻版本只存小差异」是同一个直觉在不同层面的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当-myers-给出难读的-diff\">当 Myers 给出难读的 diff</h2><p>Myers 求的是「编辑量最小」，但「最小」不等于「最好读」。经典反例是给函数列表里插入一个新函数：Myers 可能把差异拆成「上一个函数的 <code>}</code> 配新函数开头、新函数的 <code>}</code> 配下一个开头」这种错位，因为这样恰好行数最少，却完全违背人的直觉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始代码块] --&gt; M[myers: 最小编辑量&lt;br/&gt;可能错位匹配 大括号]&#10;  A --&gt; H[histogram: 先锚定唯一行&lt;br/&gt;对齐更符合人类阅读]&#10;  M --&gt; R1[diff 难读 边界错位]&#10;  H --&gt; R2[diff 清爽 函数整块新增]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始代码块] --&gt; M[myers: 最小编辑量&lt;br/&gt;可能错位匹配 大括号]\n  A --&gt; H[histogram: 先锚定唯一行&lt;br/&gt;对齐更符合人类阅读]\n  M --&gt; R1[diff 难读 边界错位]\n  H --&gt; R2[diff 清爽 函数整块新增]</pre><p><strong>patience</strong> 和 <strong>histogram</strong> 算法专治此症：它们先找出两边都<strong>唯一出现</strong>的行作为可靠锚点，以锚点切分再递归处理子段，避免被大量重复的 <code>}</code>、空行误导。许多团队把 <code>git config --global diff.algorithm histogram</code> 设为默认，就是为了让 review 时的 diff 更贴近真实意图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三路合并-自动融合的关键\">三路合并:自动融合的关键</h2><p><a href=\"../core-operations/merging-rebasing\">合并与变基</a> 里说三路合并以共同祖先为基准，这里讲它如何工作。给定 base（共同祖先）、ours（我方）、theirs（对方）三个版本，Git 对每个区段判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>base→ours 变了、base→theirs 没变 → 采纳 ours；</li>\n<li>base→theirs 变了、base→ours 没变 → 采纳 theirs；</li>\n<li>两边都没变 → 保持 base；</li>\n<li>两边都改了<strong>同一区段</strong> → 冲突，写入 <code>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;</code> 标记交给人。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键在于「有 base 才能区分新增与冲突」。没有共同祖先的两路比对无法知道「这行是某方新加的，还是另一方删掉的」，三路合并正是靠 base 把「改动」归因到具体某一方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"递归合并-不止一个共同祖先\">递归合并:不止一个共同祖先</h2><p>现实没那么简单：当历史里有过交叉合并时，两条分支可能存在<strong>多个</strong>共同祖先，到底拿哪个当 base？Git 默认的 <code>ort</code>（取代旧的 <code>recursive</code>）策略的做法堪称精妙——它<strong>先把多个共同祖先两两合并成一个「虚拟的合并基」</strong>，再用这个虚拟 base 做三路合并。这个「合并祖先来造 base」的过程可能递归多层，故得名递归合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  M1[共同祖先 1] --&gt; V[虚拟合并基&lt;br/&gt;由多个祖先合成]&#10;  M2[共同祖先 2] --&gt; V&#10;  V --&gt; TW[以虚拟基做三路合并]&#10;  OURS[ours] --&gt; TW&#10;  THEIRS[theirs] --&gt; TW&#10;  TW --&gt; OUT[合并结果 / 冲突]\">flowchart TD\n  M1[共同祖先 1] --&gt; V[虚拟合并基&lt;br/&gt;由多个祖先合成]\n  M2[共同祖先 2] --&gt; V\n  V --&gt; TW[以虚拟基做三路合并]\n  OURS[ours] --&gt; TW\n  THEIRS[theirs] --&gt; TW\n  TW --&gt; OUT[合并结果 / 冲突]</pre><p><code>ort</code> 策略（Git 2.33 起成为默认）比旧 <code>recursive</code> 更快、内存更省、在重命名检测上更准。理解递归合并能解释一个反直觉现象：有时两次看似无关的合并会冲突，正是因为虚拟合并基的构造暴露了更深层的分歧。这些自动融合一旦失败留下的冲突标记，正是你日后可能要靠 <a href=\"reflog-recovery\">reflog 与数据恢复</a> 来兜底的场景之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>diff 本质是求最长公共子序列 / 最短编辑脚本；朴素 DP 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(mn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mn</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>Git 默认用 Myers 算法，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((m+n)D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，利用「相邻版本差异小」做到近线性。</li>\n<li>Myers 求最小编辑量但有时难读，histogram/patience 靠锚定唯一行给出更贴近人意的 diff。</li>\n<li>三路合并以共同祖先 base 为基准，把改动归因到 ours/theirs，双方同区段改动才报冲突。</li>\n<li>多个共同祖先时，<code>ort</code>（默认）递归地把祖先合成虚拟 base，再做三路合并，更快更准。</li>\n<li>这些算法决定了 <a href=\"../core-operations/merging-rebasing\">合并与变基</a> 的自动化程度与 review 体验。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"差分与合并算法","id":"差分与合并算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LCS 与编辑距离：diff 的数学骨架","id":"lcs-与编辑距离-diff-的数学骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"Myers 算法：Git 的默认引擎","id":"myers-算法-git-的默认引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"当 Myers 给出难读的 diff","id":"当-myers-给出难读的-diff"},{"level":2,"text":"三路合并:自动融合的关键","id":"三路合并-自动融合的关键"},{"level":2,"text":"递归合并:不止一个共同祖先","id":"递归合并-不止一个共同祖先"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存储与 packfile","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals/storage-packfiles"},"next":{"title":"reflog 与数据恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals/reflog-recovery"}}